# Placement

Do not invent a new tree. Full map: `AGENT.md` (Layout + Placement).
Domain names: `CONTEXT.md`. Lenses, not folders: ADR-0000.

```text
# BAD — new package or HTML in the API
app/pipeline.py
backend/services/decision_service.py
backend/pages/chat.html

# GOOD — existing seams
backend/pipeline.py          # Application / Decision / CAUSED
backend/routes.py            # /api/lending/* JSON only
frontend/lending/src/        # React UI calls the JSON API
demo/                        # python -m demo — CLI adapter only
```

- New capability = JSON route + client in `frontend/lending/`.
- Tests stay in `tests/test_*.py` against those seams.
- Do not add `app/`, `services/`, `use_cases/`, `repositories/`, `domain/`.
